    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We present to you Dilemma. A game of incredibly foolish choices that would make actual philosophers roll in their grave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dilemma,\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be given scenarios where you can pick between two choices. See how your choice affects the scene. Enjoy playing through a simple game of answering dilemmas.</p>",
